  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "363ffcc1f97f12a7",
      "translationZh": "Flash 系列扩展了 GigaPath 和 GigaTIME，大幅提升了效率，使大规模病理学研究更易开展，也更具实用性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fbbf9aefd30ab460",
      "translationZh": "经过蒸馏的病理学基础模型骨干网络在不牺牲性能的前提下降低了计算需求，使研究人员能够对更大的患者队列开展重复分析。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0744f98890422cbc",
      "translationZh": "这些开放模型支持人群规模的科学发现，帮助研究人员在多样化的癌症数据集中探究疾病生物学、生物标志物和临床结局。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e41a727093bdc0bd",
      "translationZh": "GigaPath（在新标签页中打开）和 GigaTIME（在新标签页中打开）展示了基础模型如何利用常规采集的病理数据，支持全切片分析和肿瘤微环境建模。GigaPath-Flash 和 GigaTIME-Flash 显著提升了这些能力的效率，使研究人员能够分析更大的队列、开展更多实验，并迈向人群规模的科学发现。GigaPath-Flash 和 GigaTIME-Flash 是研究模型。它们并非为临床用途而设计，也未经过临床用途验证，包括诊断、预后、治疗选择或其他患者照护决策。其性能可能因数据集、扫描仪、机构、人群和使用场景而异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c8e6d52abbf3c4c",
      "translationZh": "计算病理学中的规模化机遇",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a9bf4b86ca3de62",
      "translationZh": "组织病理学是癌症研究中信息最丰富、最广泛可得的来源之一。每次组织活检都会产生一张全切片图像，以亚细胞分辨率捕捉细胞形态，而医院每年会生成数百万张这样的切片。这些数据包含与诊断、预后、治疗选择以及肿瘤微环境生物学相关的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93abfa6f8e75bc23",
      "translationZh": "基础模型已开始大规模发掘这些信息。但全切片图像体量庞大，通常超过十亿像素，即使仅将基础模型应用于一张切片，也需要处理数千个图像块。当一个研究问题涉及数万名患者时，计算成本会迅速增长。而人群规模的科学发现并非只需运行一次模型：它需要针对患者亚组、生物标志物和临床终点，反复进行特征提取、统计分析、假设检验和验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e169883bf592dec1",
      "translationZh": "计算成本限制了研究人员能够研究的患者、数据集、任务和假设的数量。要充分发挥病理学基础模型的潜力，我们需要能够以可负担的成本，在大规模患者人群中反复应用的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b9a5a182f2033b5c",
      "translationZh": "从 GigaPath 和 GigaTIME 到 -Flash 系列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f6e8b4ff9158dc6",
      "translationZh": "GigaPath（Nature，2024）（在新标签页中打开）是一个全切片基础模型，使用来自 Providence 的大规模真实世界组织病理学数据进行预训练。与仅在图块层面运行的模型不同，GigaPath 学习整张切片的上下文表征，同时捕捉局部细胞模式和全局组织结构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9473ee808e42c479",
      "translationZh": "GigaTIME（Cell，2026）（在新标签页中打开）将这一研究方向拓展到肿瘤微环境。GigaTIME 使用具有配对 H&E 和多重免疫荧光（mIF）数据的 40 million 个细胞进行训练，将常规 H&E 图像转换为涵盖 21 个蛋白质通道的虚拟空间蛋白质组学图谱。在应用于超过 14,000 名癌症患者后，它生成了一个虚拟群体，揭示了免疫细胞状态与临床生物标志物之间超过 1,200 项具有统计显著性的关联。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d588d0c5f0c459a2",
      "translationZh": "GigaPath 和 GigaTIME 解决了病理学数据与生物学发现的规模问题。而现在，Flash 系列模型解决的是实验规模问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69407c5e851f887f",
      "translationZh": "图 1：GigaPath/GigaTIME 模型系列概览。GigaPath-Flash 以 22M 参数提供高效的图块和切片编码器。GigaTIME-Flash 根据 H&E 预测空间蛋白质组学图谱，并用蒸馏后的 ViT-S 编码器替换 CNN 骨干网络。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "896a06607174d3a2",
      "translationZh": "介绍 GigaPath-Flash 和 GigaTIME-Flash",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5461fc11c34fa81",
      "translationZh": "Flash 系列具有共同的核心设计目标：在保留有用的病理学表征的同时，大幅减少生成和使用这些表征所需的计算资源。两个模型均基于同一个高效骨干网络构建——一个从原始十亿参数 GigaPath 编码器蒸馏而来的紧凑型 ViT-S 图块编码器——并且均依据 Apache 2.0 许可证发布。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79952c069cfec133",
      "translationZh": "GigaPath-Flash 是一个用于全切片表征学习的高效基础模型。它将一个 22M 参数的 ViT-S 图块编码器与一个 21M 参数的 LongNet 切片编码器相结合。图块编码器从原始 GigaPath ViT-g 教师模型蒸馏而来，将十亿参数模型的表征能力迁移到一个规模小一个数量级的骨干网络中。切片编码器通过膨胀注意力为所有图块嵌入融入上下文，其计算规模随图块数量线性增长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c481cc41ea879a21",
      "translationZh": "在切片级分类基准（PANDA 前列腺分级和 EBRAINS 脑肿瘤亚型分类）上，GigaPath-Flash 在全切片预训练模型中实现了最低的推理成本，同时保持了有竞争力的性能——评分与原始 GigaPath 的差距在 3% 以内，而计算量约为其 1/50。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04741ea39b54e77a",
      "translationZh": "图 2：全切片基准上的效率与性能权衡。GigaPath-Flash（红色，左上方）以显著低于其他全切片预训练模型的计算成本，实现了有竞争力的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4253fcdb489c8ab3",
      "translationZh": "GigaTIME-Flash 用 GigaPath-Flash ViT-S 编码器替换了原始 GigaTIME 的 CNN 骨干网络，并搭配轻量级卷积解码器，用于 H&E-to-mIF 转换。该模型使用 LoRA 适配器进行微调，预训练编码器的权重基本保持冻结。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ce210d5f0ecc5a7",
      "translationZh": "在涵盖脑癌、乳腺癌、结肠癌和肺癌的分布内及分布外队列中，GigaTIME-Flash 的空间蛋白质预测质量均达到或优于原始 GigaTIME。在分布外数据上的提升尤其显著，这表明基础模型骨干网络改善了对先前未见过的组织类型的泛化能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f0101365e8eca59",
      "translationZh": "图 3：GigaTIME 和 GigaTIME-Flash 在 GigaTIME 测试集及四个分布外 Prov-TMA 队列上的平均窗口化皮尔逊相关系数。GigaTIME-Flash 在所有队列上的表现均达到或优于原始模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c2cf4a9fc30f5762",
      "translationZh": "提升效率，不放弃基础模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd5557116edea389",
      "translationZh": "Flash 模型的效率提升十分显著：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07609ed028666bff",
      "translationZh": "模型 类型 效率提升",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21f46177a4ed737",
      "translationZh": "全切片基础模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5006c35912606a2",
      "translationZh": "与 GigaPath 相比，计算量约为其 1/50，预测性能达到其 97%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe0fcb943b741a4f",
      "translationZh": "与 GigaTIME 相比，速度约为其 6 倍，内存占用约为其 1/8，预测性能更好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e719e90d1cb6693a",
      "translationZh": "对于单张切片，这些差异可以缩短运行时间并降低硬件要求。在处理数万张切片时，它们可能决定一项实验究竟是否可行。为说明这一点，我们估算了在单个 A100 GPU 上为不同规模的队列生成虚拟 mIF 所需的实际耗时，假设每张切片约有 10,000 个图像块：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0bc1df6f9a539e7",
      "translationZh": "模型 1,000 张切片 100K 张切片 1M 张切片",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ed05108472d81a9",
      "translationZh": "估算假设每张切片约有 10,000 个图像块，批大小为 128，使用单个 NVIDIA A100 GPU。实际运行时间取决于切片大小、图像分块分辨率和硬件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9297e3b2f906ae03",
      "translationZh": "图 4：GigaTIME 的效率扩展表现。左：吞吐量（图像块/秒）随批大小的变化。右：GPU 峰值显存占用（GB）随批大小的变化。GigaTIME-Flash 的吞吐量可扩展至超过 1,600 个图像块/秒，而显存占用仅为原来的一小部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "274b6b2932a37c84",
      "translationZh": "开放模型发布",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a55e10f3dcba5464",
      "translationZh": "GigaPath-Flash 和 GigaTIME-Flash 均以开放权重模型的形式在 Apache 2.0 许可证下发布。模型权重和代码可在 HuggingFace 上获取：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0a059f6d99658de1",
      "translationZh": "GigaPath-Flash（在新标签页中打开）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "65e374df9fd40816",
      "translationZh": "GigaTIME-Flash（在新标签页中打开）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89885d264fda5b42",
      "translationZh": "GigaPath-Flash 和 GigaTIME-Flash：用于全切片与肿瘤微环境分析的高效病理学基础模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c290313baa71fe3",
      "translationZh": "这是一个早期研究版本。我们目前的评估仅涵盖有限的基准和队列，仍需针对更多任务、扫描仪和患者群体开展更广泛的验证。我们预计，这些模型最有价值的应用将包括初步实验范围之外的科学问题、队列和使用场景。我们欢迎社区开展评估，也同样希望收到关于这些模型在哪些方面表现出色、在哪些方面存在不足的报告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11b26d2fe74e5605",
      "translationZh": "下游临床应用将需要进一步开展多机构验证和前瞻性验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1c15b3a2682b9ea6",
      "translationZh": "AI 测试与评估：来自科学界和产业界的经验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f84de822f74cd81c",
      "translationZh": "了解 Microsoft 如何借鉴其他领域的经验，推进评估与测试，使其成为 AI 治理的支柱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3790a0ded3fecf7b",
      "translationZh": "以效率赋能科学发现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7271b9062f8a165",
      "translationZh": "GigaPath 和 GigaTIME 展示了病理学基础模型能够从全切片和肿瘤组织中学到什么。GigaPath-Flash 和 GigaTIME-Flash 向前迈出了一步，让这些能力能够用于更大规模的人群、更多实验以及更广泛的研究群体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b1e48e0320e800e",
      "translationZh": "通过提高病理学基础模型的效率，我们希望扩大研究人员能够提出的科学问题的规模。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c54dda77ba963460",
      "translationZh": "GigaPath-Flash 和 GigaTIME-Flash 是 Microsoft Research、华盛顿大学和 Providence 共同开展的研究工作。技术细节请参阅论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9266c8a666c1424e",
      "translationZh": "论文共同作者：Naoto Usuyama, Jeya Maria Jose Valanarasu, Sicong Yao, Hanwen Xu, Jaspreet Bagga, Guanghui Qin, Robert E. Kramer, Cliff Wong, Soohee Lee, Hao Qiu, Theodore Zhengde Zhao, Racheli Ben Shimol, Angela Crabtree, Kevin Matlock, Eduardo Alejandro Lozano Garcia, Naiteek Sangani, Alberto Santamaria-Pang, Maximilian Rokuss, Yashna Hasija, Naisargi Manishkumar Patel, Jason Entenmann, Alexandra Q. Bartlett, Bill J. Wright, Bernard A. Fox, Brian Piening, Sheng Zhang, Sheng Wang, Tristan Naumann, Carlo Bifulco, Hoifung Poon",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a8d9701f6aa593e",
      "translationZh": "文章《GigaPath-Flash 和 GigaTIME-Flash：以高效病理学基础模型迈向人群规模的科学发现》最先发表于 Microsoft Research。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "distilled",
      "briefZh": "经蒸馏的",
      "explanationZh": "指通过知识蒸馏，将较大模型的能力迁移到计算需求更低的模型中。"
    },
